# Natural openings, with the 21GF-DEFAULT card imported from BBA.
card    21GF-DEFAULT
dealer  S

# seat hand             | auction | expect | why
S AKJ52.K73.94.Q83      |         | 1S     | 13 HCP, five spades
S K52.A73.Q94.KJ83      |         | 1C     | 13 HCP, four clubs
S K52.A73.QJ94.K83      |         | 1D     | 13 HCP, four diamonds
S Q52.J73.Q94.K832      |         | P      | 8 HCP

# 1m may hold a five-card major (minor_openings.may_hold_5_card_major):
# on, the longer minor opens; off (21GF-WJS-MSS), the major.
S AKJ54.2.AQ8763.4      |         | 1D     | 5-6 with 14 HCP: the longer minor
S KQJ54.2.4.AK8763      |         | 1C     | six clubs, five spades: clubs
card    21GF-WJS-MSS
S AKJ54.2.AQ8763.4      |         | 1S     | off: a five-card major opens
S KQJ54.2.4.AK8763      |         | 1S     | off: spades, not clubs

# No forcing 2C opening (general.forcing_opening_2c off): a 22-count
# opens at the one level.
card    21GF-DEFAULT general.forcing_opening_2c=false
S AKQJ5.AK3.KQ4.Q3      |         | 1S     | 24 HCP: no 2C, so 1S
card    21GF-DEFAULT
S AKQJ5.AK3.KQ4.Q3      |         | 2C     | 24 HCP: 2C

# Never pass out our own artificial bid (2026-10-12; Brill round robin
# 2026-10-09, board 90000102): a pass that would end the auction in
# partner's or my own artificial bid is ruled out, and the hand runs to
# its best known fit.
dealer  N
S 8642.QJ853.73.42      | 1N P 2D X P P | 2H  | my transfer doubled and passed back: bid the hearts
N AK2.K74.QJ5.A863      | 1N P 2C X     | P   | a pass that gives partner another turn is allowed
